This directory is a copy of cl2ns (https://github.com/bigcheesesteak/cl2ns, Apache License 2.0,
commit c05ca24f7584a2585c170dfcdce3617a1671c8c5, 2026-09-16), files from its sync/ folder.

Modified by the Kalorie project on 2026-10-07:
- nightscout.py: duplicate detection uses a 2-minute time bucket (own and neighbouring buckets)
  instead of the exact created_at, because CareLink marker times drift by ~1 s between fetches
  and the same bolus/basal record was re-uploaded every few hours. "notes" no longer part of the
  treatment fingerprint (the Sensor Change note changes as the sensor ages).
- nightscout.py: readings without a timestamp are skipped instead of failing the whole sync cycle.
- Dockerfile: VOLUME instruction removed (Railway mounts its own volume at /data).
- nightscout.py: zero-rate AUTO_BASAL_DELIVERY markers are uploaded too (so a suspension differs from missing data).
- nightscout.py (2026-10-08): 780G temporary target (pump banner TEMP_TARGET) is uploaded as a Nightscout
  "Temporary Target" treatment and its duration kept up to date; banner types are logged.
